   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "大促时，你在结算页准备付款，后台有个运费险服务突然出了故障。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 5.417
    },
    {
     "text": "可你会发现，照样能下单付款，整个网站没跟着崩。",
     "start": 5.697,
     "dur": 4.343
    }
   ]
  },
  "hook-2": {
   "start": 310,
   "duration": 149,
   "audioFrames": 139,
   "audioSec": 4.633,
   "chapter": "hook",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 310,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "这是怎么做到的？",
     "start": -0.013,
     "dur": 1.351
    },
    {
     "text": "我们先看看，要是什么都不做，会发生什么。",
     "start": 1.618,
     "dur": 3.025
    }
   ]
  },
  "cascade-1": {
   "start": 459,
   "duration": 385,
   "audioFrames": 376,
   "audioSec": 12.533,
   "chapter": "cascade",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "打开结算页时，系统要顺带去问运费险服务：这一单能不能加运费险？",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 6.736
    },
    {
     "text": "比如大促时运费险服务出了故障，迟迟不回话，结算页就一直等。",
     "start": 7.016,
     "dur": 5.525
    }
   ]
  },
  "cascade-2": {
   "start": 844,
   "duration": 372,
   "audioFrames": 362,
   "audioSec": 12.067,
   "chapter": "cascade",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 385,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "等的请求越积越多，订单服务也被拖垮，连支付都跟着出问题。",
     "start": -0.012,
     "dur": 5.366
    },
    {
     "text": "一个服务出故障，一层层往外传，这就叫雪崩，也叫级联故障。",
     "start": 5.634,
     "dur": 6.435
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-1": {
   "start": 1216,
   "duration": 302,
   "audioFrames": 294,
   "audioSec": 9.8,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "给每次调用设个等待上限，到点就放弃，这叫超时。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.874
    },
    {
     "text": "超时要有，但高峰时每个请求还是要白等一次。",
     "start": 5.154,
     "dur": 4.63
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-2": {
   "start": 1518,
   "duration": 204,
   "audioFrames": 196,
   "audioSec": 6.533,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 302,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "所以还需要像家里电闸那样的开关：哪一路短路了，那一路就「啪」地跳下来。",
     "start": -0.003,
     "dur": 6.52
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-3": {
   "start": 1722,
   "duration": 474,
   "audioFrames": 464,
   "audioSec": 15.467,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 506,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "网站也一样：比如最近一百次调用里一半都失败了，就跳闸，后面的请求不再去问运费险服务，直接返回，不再去等它。",
     "start": -0.003,
     "dur": 9.786
    },
    {
     "text": "这叫熔断。",
     "start": 10.063,
     "dur": 1.039
    },
    {
     "text": "记住，熔断不能代替超时，两个要一起用。",
     "start": 11.382,
     "dur": 4.095
    }
   ]
  },
  "states-1": {
   "start": 2196,
   "duration": 432,
   "audioFrames": 422,
   "audioSec": 14.067,
   "chapter": "states",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "这里有个反直觉的地方。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 1.834
    },
    {
     "text": "熔断器有三种状态，名字跟电闸一样：电闸合上才通电。",
     "start": 2.114,
     "dur": 5.409
    },
    {
     "text": "所以熔断器「关闭」，是正常调用；「打开」，是已经跳闸，拒绝请求。",
     "start": 7.803,
     "dur": 6.275
    }
   ]
  },
